    <briefdescription>
<para>Comprehensive audit logging for voice authentication events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides structured logging of all security-relevant events:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Authentication attempts (success/failure)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Session lifecycle (create/close/timeout)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Liveness challenges (issued/verified/expired)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Spoofing detection (passed/failed)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe: all methods acquire internal mutex. Logs are formatted as JSON for easy parsing and compliance reporting. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
